{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56034","headline":"颂云门三句语（幷余颂八首） 据实商量（《天圣广灯录》作「据实话会」） · 缘密","name":"颂云门三句语（幷余颂八首） 据实商量（《天圣广灯录》作「据实话会」）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"睡来合眼饭来餐，起坐终诸（《古尊宿语录》作「须」）勿（《天圣广灯录》作「无」）两般。\n同道尽知言不惑，十方刹土目前观（《天圣广灯录》作「看」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缘密","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}